WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,270
As stated in the Zongzong

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,070
The country wants you to use the rewards you got from the last mission

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,270
Destroy this super typhoon

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,180
Okay, Uncle Chen, I will use it now.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,200
What if the system cannot eliminate natural disasters at all?

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:18,290
What if a bug prevents the ability from being used?

7
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,790
What to do with the millions of people affected by the disaster?

8
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:33,060
Uncle Chen, how is the wind gone?

9
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,180
Have you used it yet?

10
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:40,300
Used. Wait for Uncle Chen.

11
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:47,170
The system prompts that you must be close to a certain distance before you can use it. Fortunately, it can be used, but it’s not wrong.

12
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,210
Doesn't it mean that approaching is dangerous?

13
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:56,050
Don't hesitate, Uncle Chen
